}.$\n\n- The function is strictly decreasing on its entire domain.\n\nOf the given functions, the only one that has all of these properties is as follows:\n\n![](images/9d/9dcc5a116c2a564547283783a7df7b1cd3a9ab3b76ac24dc2695c4cb367796d5.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186398158 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186110573 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "039f58e5-0f98-58b1-b2f7-9f0ee33ed075" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Values in the Domain of the Inverse Cosine Function"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a40c0d41-ab7a-5106-8e75-bfa7c1713fdd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2}{7}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186398160} {:answer/id #uuid "05d63814-3721-5df1-9ee4-ce7b9124f4b7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{6}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186398161} {:answer/id #uuid "e57920a0-525b-55ec-9484-f65f17f5b566" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{\\pi }{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186398162} {:answer/id #uuid "dc1d7c12-42bb-563d-9070-eb5fa55f3bd1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186398163} {:answer/id #uuid "f4890513-3435-5119-84b3-3f92b4c14b12" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{7}{10}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186398164}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e57920a0-525b-55ec-9484-f65f17f5b566" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{\\pi }{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186398162} :answer-field/id #uuid "1a8182c3-02a5-5e68-9327-d52d8bf2cc84" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186398159}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045